#STRINGS.UI.ARK_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.CHONGYUE.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.ARK_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.CHONGYUE.2.1"
msgid "Deals 250% ATK as Physical damage to up to 4 enemies and causes targets affected by Talent 1 to Levitate, then removes Levitate from all enemies with Levitate, activates Talent 1 on them with 100% chance, and deals 350% ATK as Physical damage Max 2 charges"
msgstr "Deals 350% ATK as Physical damage to nearby enemies.\nEnemies affected by Talent 'An End to War' are Levitated and take an additional 480% ATK as Physical damage.\nGuaranteed to trigger Talent 'An End to War' on hit.\nUnarmed only.\nMax 2 charges."

